1
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:16,680
Come in.

2
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:20,840
Uncle,

3
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:22,520
I got up early to brew this medicine

4
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:23,560
for you.

5
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:26,800
Miss Liang,

6
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:28,320
you are so thoughtful.

7
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:29,200
But

8
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:30,360
shouldn't you change the way

9
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:31,960
you address me?

10
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:41,800
The master is in poor health

11
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:43,560
and needs his medicine every day.

12
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:45,600
You're about to become
his daughter-in-law,

13
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:47,640
so naturally you should show
some filial piety occasionally.

14
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,360
From now on,

15
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:51,220
you'll be the one bringing
the master his medicine.

16
00:01:58,720 --> 00:01:59,780
What's wrong, Dad?

17
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:01,920
What happened to you?

18
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:06,040
Liang Chunsheng,

19
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:07,780
how dare you frame the master!

20
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:10,759
You set me up.

21
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:11,920
You're so ruthless.

22
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:12,680
I'm innocent.

23
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,920
You even dared to harm Master He.

24
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:15,360
You're really ruthless.

25
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,240
Master,

26
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:18,040
what should we do now?

27
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:20,960
Can someone call me an ambulance first?

28
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,620
Master, please rest well.

29
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:33,800
Madam,

30
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:34,880
we did detect

31
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:36,360
harmful substances in the medicine.

32
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:38,160
Fortunately, he was sent to the hospital
for a gastric lavage in time.

33
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:39,960
The Master is no longer in danger.

34
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,440
However, after this incident,

35
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,960
the Master's physical condition

36
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,360
is even less optimistic.

37
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:48,640
Master.

38
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:56,480
Who exactly poisoned me?

39
00:02:58,200 --> 00:02:59,520
Ms. Liang said

40
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,380
she brewed the medicine herself.

41
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:03,520
Isn't it obvious?

42
00:03:04,440 --> 00:03:05,200
What's more,

43
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:06,640
I found this

44
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:07,800
in Ms. Liang's bag.

45
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,320
This isn't mine at all.

46
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,280
This...

47
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,600
I can't believe Zhang Xin
would risk Dad's life

48
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:17,720
just to get rid of Liang Chunsheng.

49
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,240
But right now...

50
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,920
I can only play along
with Zhang Xin for now.

51
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:25,480
I've long heard
that Miss Liang likes visiting Thailand.

52
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:26,920
So that's the reason.

53
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:27,720
Nonsense!

54
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:30,360
I will never allow a murderer

55
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,890
to marry into the He family.

56
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:35,200
Your wedding with Xiaoyu

57
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:37,000
is canceled.

58
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,480
I won't hold you accountable.

59
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:42,720
Please move out of the He residence.

60
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,720
I was framed.

61
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,480
Miss Liang,

62
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:51,200
If you keep making a scene,

63
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,960
you'll become a shrew.

64
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:56,140
You can know a person's face
but not their heart.

65
00:03:57,640 --> 00:04:00,280
I try to please you every day,
but you just give me the cold shoulder.

66
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,640
I don't even care about being

67
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:02,560
the Second Young Mistress
of the He family.

68
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,560
See yourself out.

69
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:21,720
Mrs. He,

70
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:27,960
the medication list.

71
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,760
I already paid for it.

72
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,640
I saw you ask the nanny
to buy an extra medicine.

73
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:36,320
That medicine contains ingredients

74
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:39,720
that will worsen my dad's condition.

75
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:42,540
Maybe the nanny bought the wrong one.

76
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,200
Zhang Xin,

77
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:48,120
I know exactly
what kind of person you are.

78
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,440
You can fool my dad,

79
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:51,200
but you can't fool me.

80
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,760
The reason I didn't expose you

81
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,400
is because

82
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:59,400
I don't want Miss Liang
to marry my second brother.

83
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:01,600
But if there's a next time,

84
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,080
and I find out

85
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:08,040
you intend to harm my dad again,

86
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:10,220
I absolutely won't spare you.

87
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:16,520
The phone is ringing.

88
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:17,760
I can hear it.

89
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:52,320
This video is shot pretty well.

90
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:56,520
How can you still joke around

91
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:57,600
at a time like this?

92
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,600
What's the rush?

93
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,840
That damn Liu Dan

94
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:03,640
didn't help me kill Li Zhangxin back then,

95
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:05,640
and now he's using it to threaten me.

96
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,120
What did he say to you?

97
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,560
He asked me for 10 million.

98
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,640
10 million.

99
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:12,440
He's quite ambitious.

100
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,000
Leave it to me.

101
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,450
I'll contact you when I'm done.

102
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:26,680
They said they're going to settle
the score with the butler.

103
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,400
No.

104
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:29,370
I have to find the butler first.

105
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:33,240
Slow down.

106
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:37,120
Hello.

107
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:39,320
Liu Dan hasn't come to work for days.

108
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:41,159
I even called him today.

109
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:42,560
He sounded very excited.

110
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,520
He said he was about to strike it rich

111
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:46,050
and quit being a male model.

112
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:48,250
Do you know where he is then?

113
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:50,640
He used to live in the company dorm,

114
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,240
but he's moved out now.

115
00:06:53,159 --> 00:06:54,090
Okay, thank you.

116
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:10,160
What did you call me here for?

117
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:17,520
Go.

118
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:18,960
Go.

119
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,680
Speak.

120
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:42,760
The He family kicked you out,

121
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:46,320
but you're always welcome here.

122
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:52,040
You're always welcome here.

123
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,360
Looking closely,

124
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:59,260
you two brothers
actually look quite alike.

125
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:01,000
It's just a pity

126
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:03,240
that seeing you reminds me of him,

127
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,440
and it makes me mad.

128
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:12,320
If this helps you cool off,

129
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,580
I'll play along to the end.

130
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:18,120
Without He Yu,

131
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:20,600
you've passed your expiration date

132
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:22,560
with me.

133
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:34,400
Turning your back
after getting what you want.

134
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:36,039
This is the insurance
you bought for your husband

135
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:37,520
and Mrs. He.

136
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:39,010
The beneficiary is you.

137
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:42,100
Please check if there are any issues.

138
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,320
He's in such a hurry.

139
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,180
He must be going to see the butler.

140
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,480
You're crazy.

141
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:12,730
Next time, it'll be sulfuric acid.

142
00:10:17,640 --> 00:10:18,440
You...

143
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:21,360
You bitch, you framed me!

144
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:23,200
I didn't frame you.

145
00:10:23,520 --> 00:10:25,960
It was Li Zhangxin who made me do it.

146
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:28,320
She did it to break you and He Yu up.

147
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:32,000
I did always want to harm the master,

148
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:34,560
so she got leverage on me.

149
00:10:35,160 --> 00:10:36,120
Let go of me!

150
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:38,120
Let go!

151
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,080
Really.

152
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:41,160
If you don't believe me,

153
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:42,960
look at our chat records.

154
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:45,400
She even has my medicine purchase list.

155
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:06,920
Why is it you?

156
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:08,810
Where is Mrs. He?

157
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,480
I'm here in her place.

158
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,000
Fine.

159
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:13,620
Where's the money?

160
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:25,360
You tricked me!

161
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:36,800
Help!

162
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,120
Speak!

163
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,560
What else do you want to say?
